<title>USA: TABLE - Orphan Medical Inc Q2 loss widens.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Orphan Medical Inc Q2 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended	Six Months Ended</p>
<p>			     June 30		     June 30</p>
<p>		     1997	   1996	   1997	   1996</p>
<p> Net Sales    $162,286	    $--     $266,710	    $--</p>
<p> Gross Profit   85,300	     --	146,029	     --</p>
<p>Net Loss  (4,481,728)  (1,300,604)  (6,070,510)  (3,012,817)</p>
<p>Net Loss per Share</p>
<p>		     (.74)	  (.24)	 (1.00)	  (.65)</p>
<p>Average Number of Shares Outstanding</p>
<p>		 6,063,088    5,483,544    6,062,005    4,611,566</p>
<p>NOTE: The net loss for the second quarter and the first half of 1997 include a $2.2 million charge to earnings related to the June termination of an agreement under which Chronimed Inc had exclusive rights to market and distribute certain Orphan Medical products.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
